Package: awto-truesearchd
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3
Description: filename search daemon for Samba Spotlight (truesearch backend)
 Serves Samba's `spotlight backend = truesearch` unix socket protocol (rix v1)
 from a SQLite filename index, trimmed per asking identity. Clean-room, written
 from Samba's public mdssvc_truesearch.c and truenas_truesearch.x.
